        {
          "id": "463c634a-b634-4bb5-bdba-a0d44ec173b5",
          "name": "User logout",
          "request": {
            "name": "User logout",
            "description": {
              "content": "Log out a user by invalidating their refresh token and clearing session cookies.\n\n**Logout Types:**\n- **Standard Logout**: Invalidates only the provided refresh token\n- **Universal Logout**: If `isUniversalLogout` is true, invalidates all refresh tokens for the user\n\n**Behavior:**\n- Validates the provided refresh token\n- Invalidates the token(s) based on logout type\n- Clears authentication cookies by setting them to null\n- Returns 204 No Content on success\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `refreshToken` (required): The refresh token to invalidate\n- `isUniversalLogout` (optional): Whether to invalidate all user sessions (default: false)\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "logout"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "disabled": false,
                "description": "(Required) tenant-id of the client integrating with guardian",
                "key": "tenant-id",
                "value": "<string>"
